                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Any Hero Phase</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible friendly **^^Stormcast Eternals Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^** wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">The next time this turn that the target uses a **^^Prayer^^** or **^^Spell^^** ability, instead of making a casting roll or chanting roll for them, you can use a value of 7 for the roll that cannot be modified. After that ability is resolved, if the target has any ritual points, reset their ritual points total to 0.
**Designer&apos;s Note:** *Ritual points apply modifiers so cannot be used with this ability to increase the chanting roll to more than 7.*</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
                    <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
                  </characteristics>
