                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Start of Any Turn</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the enemy target, then you can pick a friendly **^^Stormcast Eternals^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the friendly target</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Spend 1 rage dice. If your opponent&apos;s **fury level** is lower than yours, they must increase their **fury level** by 1, to a maximum of 7. Then, for the rest of the turn, while it is visible to this unit:
• Subtract 1 from casting rolls and chanting rolls for the enemy target.
• Add 1 to casting rolls and chanting rolls for the friendly target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
                    <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
