                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time this unit is set up using the &apos;Scions of the Storm&apos; ability, subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks that target this unit for the rest of the battle round.
In addition, each time a friendly **^^Stormcast Eternals^^** unit is set up wholly within 12&quot; of this unit using the &apos;Scions of the Storm&apos; ability, subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks that target that unit for the rest of the battle round.</characteristic>
